# Prettier owns this repository's own source. It does not own:

# Another repository, vendored as a submodule. Reformatting it would rewrite files
# this repo does not maintain, and the diff would never land anywhere.
/.rak200/

# Seeded files, conformance-checked byte for byte or under a mask. A formatter that
# rewrites a seed turns the next CI run red for a reason nobody will guess.
/.github/

# Generated by release-please. Formatting it starts an argument with the tool that
# rewrites it on every release.
/CHANGELOG.md

# Build output and tool scratch.
/dist/
/coverage/
/.stryker-tmp/
/package-lock.json
